## 8. ALETHEIA PROVIDERS

### 8.1 Nativos (Built-in)

| Provider | ID | Status | Comando |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Claude Code** | `claude` | ✅ Operacional | `claude --print --output-format stream-json --verbose --permission-mode acceptEdits --disallowedTools Agent,Workflow --strict-mcp-config --model <m> --effort <e>` |
| **Agy** | `agy` | ⚠️ Requer API Key (env var) | `agy --output-format json --mode accept-edits --print-timeout 300s --add-dir <cwd> --print=<task>` |
| **Codex** | `codex` | ❌ Não instalado | - |
| **Kimi** | `kimi` | ❌ Não instalado | - |

### 8.2 Custom Provider: GitHub Copilot CLI

```yaml
# playbooks.yaml → adapters
copilot:
  command: "copilot"
  args: ["-p", "{task}", "--yolo", "--output-format", "json", "-C", "{cwd}", "--session-id", "{session_id}"]
  promptTransport: "argument"
  outputFormat: "jsonl"
  capabilities: {readOnly: true, write: true, resume: true, structuredOutput: true, tokenUsage: true}
  modelSources: [GitHub default, BYOK Anthropic, BYOK OpenAI, BYOK Azure, BYOK Ollama, 9Router]
```

### 8.3 NÃO Acionáveis pela Aletheia

- KiloCode (VS Code only)
- Gemini CLI (não autenticado)
- Extensões VS Code (ChatGPT, Codex Audio, etc.)
- 9Router (gateway, não worker)

